OL,3,GNEWSAWoman told PC 'get off me' 300
OL,4,Atimes as he raped her
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman told a police officer to "get
OL,7,Foff me" more than 300 times as he
OL,8,Fsubjected her to an 82-minute violent
OL,9,Frape attack in a Liverpool hotel room.
OL,11,FFormer Merseyside Police Constable Ryan
OL,12,FTheaker, 30, was revealed as a sex
OL,13,Foffender after the victim began
OL,14,Fsecretly recording him on her phone
OL,15,Fafter a night out in 2023.
OL,17,FThe woman, who cannot be named to
OL,18,Fprotect her anonymity, read an
OL,19,Femotional statement at Liverpool Crown
OL,20,FCourt and faced the dock as she told
OL,21,FTheaker "monsters never win".
